<title>FRANCE: UCAR buys 70 percent of Pechiney unit.</title>
<headline>UCAR buys 70 percent of Pechiney unit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aluminium group Pechiney said on Wednesday that UCAR International Inc had bought 70 percent of the shares of its Carbone Savoie unit for 172 million francs, leaving Pechiney with a 30 percent minority stake.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the deal followed discussions between UCAR and Pechiney on plans to link up some activities.</p>
<p>Carbone Savoie manufactures carbon cathode blocks which are consumed in the production of aluminium.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
